  "sample": "16 independent randomized synthetic task/input histories conditional on one preserved founder, each with six paired continuations. Not independent founders.",
  "entry": "Existing full graph added on a copy; strong synthetic 2 then 3 cues; eight independently seeded adaptive-contrast burn-in offers. Control is projected to zone 2 and receives an explicit topology-matched 2/7 adapter; both conditions share the preceding Warp history.",
  "intervention": "Six conditions: Warp vs graph-matched 2/7 crossed with correct, unrelated and masked feedback. Correct encodes actual public error-count parity; unrelated encodes an unrelated public diagnostic; masked sends uniform attention. Direct text uses the same condition. Failure presence and timing remain observable.",
  "attention": "Both correct and unrelated signals use the adaptive-source weight multiset with an absolute proposal-versus-diagnostic contrast of 0.060; masked attention is uniform.",
  "task": "Bounded JSON priority expressions interpreted by trusted code on six public unit-cost cases, their weighted versions, and eight independently generated hidden weighted cases. No generated code is executed.",
  "primary": "Per history, final hidden pass count (out of 8); compare Warp/correct with matched control/correct, and Warp/correct with Warp/unrelated. Count stalled or invalid candidates by their actual held-out score; do not exclude them.",
  "decision": "For a Warp-specific diagnostic advantage require both mean paired differences >=1/8 and both exact one-sided block sign-flip probabilities <=0.05, under the stated conditional exchangeability assumption. Otherwise do not claim the advantage. These thresholds were fixed before the 16 new histories, after the explicitly disclosed two-history feasibility pilot.",
  "secondary": "All three feedback arms, all gate pivotal rates, and whole-PFM swaps between correct and masked exposures within identical recipient backgrounds, over 24 no-new-input steps.",
  "limitations": "LLM calls are remote and need not be deterministic; feedback strings match in character length, not guaranteed token count; model revises only a bounded grammar. One shared founder, not an Outside test or evidence of general intelligence.",
